'''Battle Cats TV''' (にゃんこTV, Lit. '''Nyanko TV''') is a series on the [https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCORhp_TycEGGw-PEo6igDMg Nyanko Studio Official Channel].

Each episode of Battle Cats TV features mascot Prof. Cat (''Neko-sensei'', lit. '''Teacher Cat''') bringing players news about recent and ongoing events, updates and campaigns. The videos average 6~8 minutes in length and are generally comedic in tone, especially in the opening segments, which star [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]]. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1dWFep0J8OY Episode 1] was uploaded on December 31st, 2018.

A [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] greatly resembling a younger Prof. Cat, called [[Cat Boy (Special Cat)|Cat Boy]], was added to [[Nyanko Daisensou]] in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]], which can be obtained from [https://ponos.s3.amazonaws.com/information/appli/battlecats/question/nyankoTV_202003.html this site] ever since the channel reached 150,000 subscribers on September 19th, 2020.

